    {
      "_id": "rVzYjRngnBLPBqTV",
      "name": "腐蝕金屬Corrode Metal",
      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "243",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">以金屬製的非魔法武器攻擊命中泥怪後將被腐蝕。造成傷害後，該武器所作的傷害擲骰將永久承受</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">-1</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">減值且累計疊加。如果減值總和達到</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">-5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">，則該武器被摧毀。由金屬製作的非魔法彈藥在擊中泥怪並造成傷害後將隨即被摧毀。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">泥怪在</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">輪時間裏可以喫掉</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">寸厚的非魔法金屬。</span></p><p>Any nonmagical weapon made of metal that hits the ooze corrodes. After dealing damage, the weapon takes a permanent and cumulative −1 penalty to damage rolls. If its penalty drops to −5, the weapon is destroyed. Nonmagical ammunition made of metal that hits the ooze is destroyed after dealing damage.</p><p>The ooze can eat through 2-inch-thick, nonmagical metal in 1 round.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
